  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The name first appears when Fang Yuan watches Gu Yue Qing Shu spar Xiong Li on Alliance slope and spots two emerald-green leaves in Qing Shu’s hair. Fang Yuan names that sign as Wood Charm Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          126
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_gu_yue_qing_shu",
          "char_xiong_li"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Qing Shu activates Wood Charm Gu when Bai Ning Bing demands Fang Yuan’s location and Qing Shu refuses to betray his clansman.",
        "chapters": [
          140
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is the first time he uses the Gu without considering the consequences. His body turns toward tree spirit form: tree-ring flesh, bark skin, lengthening ears, jade-green leaf hair, then a full three-meter tree spirit shape after Blue Bird Ice Coffin freezes him.",
        "chapters": [
          141
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In that form he feels rich natural essence in the air as an almost infinite primeval essence source. Green Vine Gu, Pin Needle Gu, and vitality grass show growth and gain power as wood attribute Gu, while Moonwhirl Gu does not change that way.",
        "chapters": [
          141
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_moonwhirl_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At rank three, Northern Dark Ice Soul recovery is still slightly inferior to the tree spirit’s natural essence extraction; rank four recovery would greatly surpass Wood Charm Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          142
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He knows unrestrained use ends as a dead treeman, and Bai Ning Bing asks the same question mid-fight. Bai Ning Bing also names the look as Wood Charm Gu refined, and says that Gu is harder to refine than Frost Demon Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          141
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_frost_demon_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu’s strength then corrodes his whole body, takes over eyes and hearing, and begins to take over his consciousness, bringing him to the brink of death while he still nearly strangles Bai Ning Bing.",
        "chapters": [
          142
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Frost Demon Gu is on par with Wood Charm Gu in value; it transforms the user into a frost demon and, with extended use, dwindles the life force into an ice statue.",
        "chapters": [
          143
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Qing Shu could surpass levels because he had Wood Charm Gu, a powerful and special rank three Gu worm.",
        "chapters": [
          145
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fight-against-bai-ning-bing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After Qing Mao Mountain’s power struggle, Fang Yuan notes that if clan errands had not eaten Qing Shu’s time, Qing Shu might have broken through rank two peak stage to rank three, then used Wood Charm Gu and perhaps killed Bai Ning Bing.",
        "chapters": [
          161
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "qing-shu-potential",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
